<newsitem itemid="144155" id="root" date="1996-10-25" xml:lang="en">
<title>USA: Cabot Corp Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Cabot Corp Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months	 Twelve Months</p>
<p>					Dollars in millions,</p>
<p>				     except per share amounts</p>
<p>					 1996    1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales			  464.6   426.3  1,856.3  1,830.4</p>
<p> Net income			  72.0    44.6    194.1    171.9</p>
<p>INCOME PER COMMON SHARE</p>
<p> Primary			     0.98    0.57     2.60     2.17</p>
<p> Fully Diluted		     0.90    0.53     2.42     2.02</p>
<p>AVERAGE NUMBER OF SHARES</p>
<p>OUTSTANDING (000's)</p>
<p> Primary			   72,995  77,350   73,237   77,452</p>
<p> Fully Diluted		   79,115  83,498   79,345   83,880</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q4 results include a $38.9 million gain from the sale of its coal transportation business, Tuco Inc. 1995 Q4 results include a $32.6 million gain from the sale of net assets of its safety products business.</p>
<p>Share and per share amounts have been restated to reflect a two-for-one stock split during 1996 Q2.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
